sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User (SPA)
    participant API as NativeAuthEndpoints
    participant NC as NativeAuthClient
    participant CIAM as Entra External ID (CIAM)

    U->>API: POST /api/auth/native/refresh {refreshToken}
    API->>NC: RefreshTokenAsync(refreshToken)
    NC->>CIAM: oauth2/v2.0/token (grant_type=refresh_token)
    CIAM-->>NC: new access_token, id_token, refresh_token
    NC-->>API: NativeAuthTokenResult
    API-->>U: 200 AuthTokensResponse
